    ^{:line 90 :tag CookieJar :doc "Jar specifies the cookie jar.\n\nThe Jar is used to insert relevant cookies into every\noutbound Request and is updated with the cookie values\nof every inbound Response. The Jar is consulted for every\nredirect that the Client follows.\n\nIf Jar is nil, cookies are only sent if they are explicitly\nset on the Request.\n"} Jar
















